#----------------------------- Global Properties ----------------------------#

# The SAME content project as Content.mgcb, built through ShadowDusk's MGCB
# content-processor plugin instead of MonoGame's built-in effect compiler.
# Everything below differs from Content.mgcb in exactly three ways: the output
# directories, the /reference: line, and the /importer: + /processor: names.
#
# Build it (from samples/mgcb/Content):
#     dotnet build ../../../src/ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin/ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin.csproj
#     dotnet mgcb /@:Content.ShadowDusk.mgcb
#
# A consumer using the NuGet package points /reference: at the package instead:
#     /reference:$(NuGetPackageRoot)shadowdusk.mgcbplugin/<version>/tools/net8.0/any/ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin.dll
# (spell the path out - MGCB does not expand MSBuild properties in a .mgcb).

/outputDir:bin/shadowdusk/$(Platform)
/intermediateDir:obj/shadowdusk/$(Platform)
/platform:DesktopGL
/config:
/profile:Reach
/compress:False

#-------------------------------- References --------------------------------#

/reference:../../../src/ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin/bin/Debug/net8.0/ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin.dll

#---------------------------------- Content ---------------------------------#

# NOTE - 10 of Content.mgcb's 34 effects are deliberately absent here:
#   BasicEffect, AlphaTestEffect, DualTextureEffect, EnvironmentMapEffect,
#   SkinnedEffect, SpriteEffect, PenumbraHull, PenumbraLight, PenumbraShadow,
#   PenumbraTexture.
# All ten declare their techniques through PREPROCESSOR MACROS, which ShadowDusk's
# OpenGL path cannot yet compile (SD0010 "Effect source contains no techniques" -
# the Phase 41 GAP-1 GL half, blocked on DXC legacy-SM2 codegen). This is a LIBRARY
# gap, identical through the ShadowDusk CLI, not a plugin one: the plugin adds no
# compilation logic, so it inherits exactly what the library supports. They stay in
# Content.mgcb (MonoGame's own compiler builds them) so the difference stays visible.

#begin ../../../tests/fixtures/shaders/BasicShader.fx
/importer:ShadowDuskEffectImporter
/processor:ShadowDuskEffectProcessor
/processorParam:DebugMode=Auto
/build:../../../tests/fixtures/shaders/BasicShader.fx;BasicShader

#begin ../../../tests/fixtures/shaders/TintShader.fx
/importer:ShadowDuskEffectImporter
/processor:ShadowDuskEffectProcessor
/processorParam:DebugMode=Auto
/build:../../../tests/fixtures/shaders/TintShader.fx;TintShader

